{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_023940","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你们带来的咖啡，真好喝。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"JPN_TONE_OVER_AUX_PROFANITY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"是吧？哥斯达黎加的咖啡很好喝的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"中央盆地具备最适合种咖啡的各种条件。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"海拔高，气温变化小。土壤又是火山土，排水也很好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"“教授”也相当着迷。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"来时船上喝的咖啡不好喝，教授一路都在生闷气呢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可既然这么好，我倒很少听到“哥斯达黎加咖啡”这个名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"好像是被商家收购以后，就会和其他国家的咖啡豆混在一起……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"明明能产出这么好的豆子，却没人知道它们来自哥斯达黎加，真让人不甘心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"那就好好宣传一下。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"嗯。希望将来“哥斯达黎加咖啡”这个名字能得到应有的评价。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}